    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89041" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσελλείπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be still wanting</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.
				τῷ σταδίῳ στάδιον</span>
			<i>fail</i> by the whole length of the course, of a very slow
			runner, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.85
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ προσελλείποντα τῶν
			χρημάτων</span> the sums <i>still wanting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.101
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.4.9
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Aegina</span>).</div>
